Cell["Final Quotient Space", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"9a7a2783-6df9-9c48-b111-e07d432ae5bf"],

Cell["\<\
The final interaction basis is the double quotient (V_{nh,Nd} / T_{nh,Nd}) / \
R_{nh,Nd}, where R_{nh,Nd} is the field-redefinition image inside the IBP \
quotient. This is the precise meaning of the toolkit's PhysicalBasis for nh \
>= 3.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"859bcca9-44de-db43-98a6-dcf6068effe8"],

Cell["Why Quadratic Sectors Are Different", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"54aaaf8c-02a0-a14f-a489-7aef7ee0e478"],

